WEBVTT

00:09:24.204 --> 00:09:30.954
a friend at work. So clearly, at least,
their concept of engagement,

00:09:30.954 --> 00:09:34.037
which is the one the only one
that they know much about,

00:09:34.371 --> 00:09:36.621
is by and large a positive concept.

00:09:37.037 --> 00:09:42.954
And certainly the word we don't want
people to be compulsive, although.

00:09:46.037 --> 00:09:49.204
Although I don't know how to describe
myself, for example,

00:09:49.621 --> 00:09:53.621
when when I work hard or when
I used to work very hard,

00:09:54.162 --> 00:09:59.662
was I doing so compulsively, was doing
so out of intrinsic motivation?

00:09:59.704 --> 00:10:04.412
I think both I was intrinsically motivated
and I was compulsive about.